  "$schema": "doc/wasm-deps.schema.md",
  "comment": [
    "Pegged dependency graph for wasm32 cross-compilation. The IDE supports",
    "exactly one Lean version (v4.27.0) and one cut of Mathlib at a time; if",
    "we need to support more, add a new entry under `libraries` and tag the",
    "CDN slug accordingly (e.g. `mathlib-v4.27.0-2026-04`).",
    "",
    "The build script (scripts/build-wasm-deps.sh) consumes this file:",
    "  1. Clone each repo at `rev` into a scratch workspace.",
    "  2. Run `lake build` using the wasm32 lean toolchain in vendor/.",
    "  3. Pack resulting *.olean / *.olean.private / *.olean.server / *.ir",
    "     into cdn/projects/<slug>/oleans.bundle.",
    "  4. Write cdn/projects/<slug>/sources.json with .lean source files.",
    "",
    "This file is the dependency contract. Do not change a `rev` without",
    "rebuilding the affected libraries — IDE users will hit",
    "'incompatible header' otherwise."
  ],
